# Manual memory: a string literal is a non-owning .rodata view (is_owned == 0),
# so 'banish' on it is a safe no-op instead of a double free.
weave main into int:
    var s is "literal"
    banish s
    if s.len != 0:
        return 1
    # Banishing twice is still safe: the first call left the view empty.
    banish s
    return 0
